OL,3,AFour arrested after police officer
OL,4,Ainjured in shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been arrested -
OL,7,Fincluding a woman on suspicion of
OL,8,Fcausing grievous bodily harm and
OL,9,Fpossessing a firearm - after a police
OL,10,Fofficer was shot in Nottingham city
OL,11,Fcentre.
OL,13,FNottinghamshire Police said the officer
OL,14,Fhad approached two suspects at a bus
OL,15,Fstop in Angel Row shortly before 04:50
OL,16,FBST on Sunday.
OL,18,FThe male officer remains in hospital
OL,19,Fand is in a stable condition, the force
OL,20,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
