OL,3,AFrench PM calls for partial curfews as
OL,4,Ahe condemns 'thieves' and 'thugs'
OL,5,Abehind riots
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome French cities have been given the
OL,8,Fpower to implement partial curfews to
OL,9,Fprotect people and shops, says PM
OL,10,FSebastien Lecornu - our correspondent
OL,11,FHugh Schofield looks at what that might
OL,12,Fmean
OL,14,FIt comes after a weekend of riots and
OL,15,Flooting, with Lecornu saying "we will
OL,16,Fnot be dictated and ruled by the
OL,17,Fbreakers, by the thieves, by the thugs"
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
